CypherBench (https://github.com/megagonlabs/cypherbench)
Copyright Megagon Labs, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The execution-accuracy comparison helpers in `eval/run_public.py` are
vendored from `cypherbench/metrics/execution_accuracy.py` so that theorem's
published results are scored by the benchmark's own comparator rather than
by a reimplementation of it. The vendored block is marked in that file.

CypherBench's graphs, questions and gold answers are not redistributed here.
They are downloaded from huggingface.co/datasets/megagonlabs/cypherbench at
evaluation time, and `eval/data/` is not tracked.

